{"id":"level-up-2026-09-16","name":"2026-09-16 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s1","en":"We had to cancel our booking because the train stopped running.","zh":"火车停运了，我们只好取消预订。","note":"cancel · 取消， 废除； 抵消， 对消； 删去， 划掉 · cancel a booking","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s2","en":"The town experienced explosive growth after the new railway opened.","zh":"新铁路开通后，这个城镇迅速发展。","note":"explosive · 爆炸的， 爆发的； 使人冲动的；爆炸物，炸药 · explosive growth","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s3","en":"Maya stayed home to prepare for her final exam.","zh":"玛雅留在家里准备期末考试。","note":"prepare · 准备， 预备 · prepare for an exam","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s4","en":"The students began a crusade against food waste on campus.","zh":"学生们在校园发起了反对食物浪费的运动。","note":"crusade · 加入十字军， 投身正义运动；十字军；斗争，运动 · a crusade against waste","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s5","en":"A narrow footpath connects the remote hamlet to the main road.","zh":"一条狭窄的小路把这个偏远村庄与大路连接起来。","note":"hamlet · 小村庄 · a remote hamlet","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s6","en":"The surgeon explained the procedure carefully before answering our questions.","zh":"外科医生仔细解释了手术流程，然后回答我们的问题。","note":"surgeon · 外科医生 · a skilled surgeon","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s7","en":"Please leave your wet umbrella in the entrance hall.","zh":"请把湿雨伞放在门厅。","note":"hall · 门厅； 礼堂 · the entrance hall","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s8","en":"One disappointing result should not discourage you from trying again.","zh":"一次令人失望的结果不该让你放弃再次尝试。","note":"discourage · 使泄气， 使灰心； 阻止， 劝阻 · discourage someone from doing","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s9","en":"Early success may predispose students to expect equally easy progress later.","zh":"早期的成功可能使学生倾向于期待以后也能轻松进步。","note":"predispose · 事先影响某人； 偏爱； 易受感染 · predispose someone to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s10","en":"An experienced engineer will oversee the bridge repair project.","zh":"一位经验丰富的工程师将监督桥梁维修项目。","note":"oversee · 监督， 监视； 俯瞰， 眺望 · oversee a project","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s11","en":"The city introduced cleaner buses to reduce air pollution.","zh":"这座城市引进了更清洁的公交车，以减少空气污染。","note":"pollution · 污染， 污染物； 玷污 · air pollution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s12","en":"I tried to pretend to be asleep when the children entered.","zh":"孩子们进来时，我试图装睡。","note":"pretend · 装作， 假装 · pretend to be asleep","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s13","en":"The teacher used coloured water to demonstrate convection currents.","zh":"老师用有色水演示对流。","note":"convection · 传送； 对流 · convection currents","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s14","en":"These unexpected results warrant further investigation before we publish.","zh":"这些意外结果值得进一步调查后再发表。","note":"warrant · 保证； · warrant further investigation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s15","en":"The diagram shows Earth's orbit within the ecliptic plane.","zh":"这张图展示了地球在黄道平面内的轨道。","note":"ecliptic · 【天】 · the ecliptic plane","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s16","en":"The damaged label could not conceal the bottle's age.","zh":"破损的标签无法掩盖这个瓶子的年代。","note":"conceal · 隐藏； 隐瞒； 掩盖 · conceal the truth","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s17","en":"Beginners sometimes overrate their ability and choose routes that are too difficult.","zh":"初学者有时高估自己的能力，选择过于困难的路线。","note":"overrate · 对…评价过高， 高估 · overrate one's ability","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s18","en":"I watered the garden; meanwhile, my brother prepared lunch.","zh":"我给花园浇水；与此同时，弟弟准备午餐。","note":"meanwhile · 与此同时 · meanwhile at home","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s19","en":"The hotel's opulent interior contrasted with its plain stone exterior.","zh":"酒店豪华的内部与朴素的石质外观形成对比。","note":"opulent · 豪华的， 华丽的， 富裕的； 丰富的， 丰饶的 · an opulent interior","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s20","en":"My visit will coincide with the opening of the exhibition.","zh":"我到访的时间将恰逢展览开幕。","note":"coincide · 同时发生； 一致 · coincide with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s21","en":"We need a competent manager who can organise the new team.","zh":"我们需要一位能组织新团队的称职经理。","note":"competent · 有能力的； 能胜任的 · a competent manager","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s22","en":"Changes to the timetable require approval from the course director.","zh":"课表调整需要课程主任批准。","note":"require · 需要； 命令； 规定， 要求 · require approval","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s23","en":"Be careful not to scratch the surface of the wooden table.","zh":"小心别划伤木桌的表面。","note":"scratch · 划伤， · scratch the surface","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s24","en":"The volunteers offered compassionate support to families after the flood.","zh":"洪水过后，志愿者为各家提供了充满关怀的支持。","note":"compassionate · 有同情心的， 表示怜悯的 · compassionate care","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s25","en":"A cooperative approach helped both teams finish the project early.","zh":"合作的方式帮助两个团队提前完成了项目。","note":"cooperative · 合作的，协作的；合作社 · a cooperative approach","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s26","en":"The team's strategist adjusted the plan after studying the opposition.","zh":"团队的策略师研究对手后调整了计划。","note":"strategist · 战略家 · a skilled strategist","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s27","en":"After a sleepless night, I felt irritable during the morning meeting.","zh":"一夜未眠后，我在早会上感到烦躁。","note":"irritable · 急躁的， 易怒的， 易受刺激的； 过敏的 · feel irritable","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s28","en":"We need to triple the amount of rice for tonight's guests.","zh":"为了今晚的客人，我们需要把米量增加到三倍。","note":"triple · 三部分的；三倍的；增至三倍 · triple the amount","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s29","en":"Although usually reserved, she spoke confidently about her research.","zh":"她通常话不多，但谈起自己的研究却很自信。","note":"reserved · 说话不多的， 内向的； 有所保留的， 预订的 · a reserved manner","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s30","en":"He lost his temper when the printer jammed again.","zh":"打印机再次卡纸时，他发火了。","note":"temper · 情绪；使缓和 · lose one's temper","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s31","en":"The children laughed as tiny waves began to tickle their feet.","zh":"小浪花开始挠孩子们的脚，他们笑了起来。","note":"tickle · 发痒；使高兴，逗乐；痒 · tickle someone's feet","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s32","en":"Several residents object to the proposal because it removes public gardens.","zh":"几位居民反对该提议，因为它会取消公共花园。","note":"object · 反对， 不赞成；物体；对象；目标；宾语[əb'dʒekt] · object to a proposal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s33","en":"The museum is easily accessible by bus from the station.","zh":"从车站乘公交可以方便地到达博物馆。","note":"accessible · 能接近的； 易达到的 · easily accessible","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s34","en":"We will hang the picture above the living room sofa.","zh":"我们会把这幅画挂在客厅沙发上方。","note":"hang · 悬挂， 吊， 垂下； 吊死， 绞死 · hang a picture","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s35","en":"Experts examined the pigments to authenticate the recently discovered painting.","zh":"专家检查颜料，以鉴定这幅新近发现画作的真伪。","note":"authenticate · 鉴别， 证明 · authenticate a painting","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s36","en":"Two small tables should suffice for our exhibition materials.","zh":"两张小桌子应该足够放我们的展览材料。","note":"suffice · 满足， 满意； 足够 · suffice for","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s37","en":"She had to concede that the cheaper design was more practical.","zh":"她不得不承认，更便宜的设计更实用。","note":"concede · 承认； 让步 · concede a point","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s38","en":"There has been a notable improvement in the river's water quality.","zh":"河流水质有了显著改善。","note":"notable · 值得注意的；显著的，杰出的，显赫的；名人， 要人 · a notable improvement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s39","en":"The archive offers researchers unparalleled access to the writer's private letters.","zh":"该档案馆为研究者提供了无与伦比的作家私人信件查阅条件。","note":"unparalleled · 无双的， 无比的， 空前的 · unparalleled access","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s40","en":"We sank into a plush sofa beside the hotel fireplace.","zh":"我们坐进酒店壁炉旁柔软舒适的沙发里。","note":"plush · 豪华的，舒适的；长毛绒 · a plush sofa","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s41","en":"Water will evaporate more quickly from a shallow open dish.","zh":"水从敞口浅盘中蒸发得更快。","note":"evaporate · 蒸发； 消失； 不复存在 · evaporate quickly","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s42","en":"The library plans to commission a portrait of its founder.","zh":"图书馆计划委托画家为创始人绘制肖像。","note":"commission · 委托；佣金；授权， 委托 · commission a portrait","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s43","en":"A narrow staircase leads to the apartment above the bakery.","zh":"一段狭窄的楼梯通向面包店楼上的公寓。","note":"staircase · 楼梯 · a spiral staircase","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s44","en":"We decided to flip a coin to choose the first player.","zh":"我们决定抛硬币来选出第一个玩家。","note":"flip · 轻抛； 轻弹 · flip a coin","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s45","en":"You can connect your laptop to the library's wireless network.","zh":"你可以把笔记本电脑连接到图书馆的无线网络。","note":"connect · 连接， 衔接； 联合， 关联； 由…联想到； 给…接通电话 · connect to a network","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s46","en":"The builders will resume work once the heavy rain stops.","zh":"大雨一停，建筑工人就会复工。","note":"resume · 重新开始， 继续恢复 · resume work","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s47","en":"The new timetable should address the problem of overcrowded classrooms.","zh":"新课表应该能解决教室过于拥挤的问题。","note":"address · 致函，写姓名地址；向…讲话，演说；处理， · address a problem","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s48","en":"The drawing class began with a study of the model's posture.","zh":"绘画课开始时，大家先研究模特的姿势。","note":"posture · 姿势； 心情； 态度 · an upright posture","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s49","en":"Housing costs continued to spiral despite the slowdown in demand.","zh":"尽管需求放缓，住房成本仍持续急剧上涨。","note":"spiral · 螺旋形的，盘旋的；盘旋上升；急剧增长；螺旋形；逐渐加速上升 · spiral upwards","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:s50","en":"The museum records explain how vandals attempted to decapitate the statue.","zh":"博物馆的记录解释了破坏者如何企图砍掉雕像的头。","note":"decapitate · 斩首 · decapitate a statue","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:w1","en":"cancel","zh":"取消， 废除； 抵消， 对消； 删去， 划掉","note":"英 /'kænsl/ · 美 /'kænsl/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0001-uk-6ed818c97ed8.mp3","text":"cancel"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0001-us-f5b66b21cb20.mp3","text":"cancel"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:w2","en":"explosive","zh":"爆炸的， 爆发的； 使人冲动的；爆炸物，炸药","note":"英 /ɪk'spləusɪv/ · 美 /ɪk'splosɪv; ɪk'splozɪv/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0002-uk-92731c3c00e4.mp3","text":"explosive"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0002-us-c15c90c46fa2.mp3","text":"explosive"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-16:w3","en":"prepare","zh":"准备， 预备","note":"英 /prɪ'peə(r)/ · 美 /prɪ'pɛr/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0003-uk-5629b4f13d60.mp3","text":"prepare"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-ar